stemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软发布 MAI Code1.1Flash 模型并为 GitHub Copilot 引入本地与云端混合推理支持</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">博通拟筹集超500亿美元私人债务，支持OpenAI定制AI芯片项目落地</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic 发布 Claude Haiku 5.5 模型，价格降幅达 90% 但存在隐性成本</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌调整Gemini订阅策略：10月9日起免费版仅限Flash-Lite模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1852f2441e292b932389d773dde75c97.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌自10月9日起调整Gemini个人账户访问权限，全面收紧模型配置。免费用户仅能访问Gemini 3.5-Flash-Lite，不再支持Gemini 3.6 Flash及更高版本。每月4.99美元的AI Plus订阅用户权限被压缩至Flash与Flash-Lite模型，不再支持Gemini 3.1 Pro等高级推理模型。每月19.99美元的Google AI Pro及Ultra订阅用户权益保持不变，仍可使用深度思考（Deep Think）及高级模型。此外，谷歌引入低、中、高三种工作量（Effort）模式，系统根据任务复杂度实时扣减配额。此次调整旨在应对推理成本增长与算力负载，通过阶梯式精细化管控，将高算力模型向高价值付费用户倾斜，标志着大模型商业化进入算力经济效益精细化运营阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软发布搭载英伟达RTX Spark芯片的Surface Laptop Ultra与工作站</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e89d7c961eb409fdfb5a22e85ba64ce4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软在旧金山科技周发布搭载英伟达RTX Spark芯片的Surface Laptop Ultra笔记本及Surface RTX Spark Dev Box工作站。Surface Laptop Ultra起售价2,600美元，顶配可达5,900美元；面向开发者的Dev Box起售价6,000美元，预装VS Code、GitHub Copilot CLI及WSL等工具。该系列设备通过专属CPU、GPU及统一内存架构，支持本地运行各类AI模型与智能体。微软同步推出重构版Windows 11，引入“Execution Containers”功能，为AI智能体提供沙箱隔离环境。CEO萨提亚·纳德拉表示，未来操作系统核心在于提供整合多模型、上下文及操作空间的协同层。为抢占市场，微软针对MacBook Pro用户提供最高1,</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软发布 MAI Code1.1Flash 模型并为 GitHub Copilot 引入本地与云端混合推理支持</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b67ed5b437d20c79921fc0ab9d1f36b7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软在2026年10月7日的发布会上宣布，将于本月底前为 GitHub Copilot 引入本地 AI 模型支持，实现云端与设备端模型的自动调度与自由切换。核心技术支撑是微软推出的 MAI Code1.1Flash 混合专家（MoE）模型，该模型拥有1370亿总参数及68亿激活参数，通过量化与投机解码技术优化了端侧推理的内存占用与响应速度，并率先搭载于新款 Surface Laptop Ultra。开发者可通过 GitHub Copilot CLI、Copilot 应用及 Visual Studio Code 调用该模型，系统集成微软执行容器（MXC）以保障代码运行安全。此次升级标志着 AI 编码助手向“云端+端侧”混合架构演进，在降低本地部署门槛的同时，为高隐私、低延迟的开发场景提供了高效的落地方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">博通拟筹集超500亿美元私人债务，支持OpenAI定制AI芯片项目落地</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/fa7d464ff0bb21f829b46e0fa3f51c2f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">博通正与阿波罗全球管理及黑石集团洽谈，计划筹集超500亿美元私人债务，专项支持OpenAI的定制AI芯片项目。该融资预计于2026年底前完成，旨在保障2026下半年至2029年底期间，双方合作部署的10吉瓦定制AI芯片系统的产能需求。除OpenAI外，博通还正为Anthropic安排高达600亿美元的AI芯片融资，其中黑石集团牵头承揽了180亿美元的次级债务。在AI算力需求激增背景下，甲骨文、SpaceX等科技巨头亦纷纷通过私人债务渠道筹措资金，以加速数据中心建设及AI芯片采购。此次大规模融资反映了AI基础设施建设对资本的极高依赖，私人债务正成为支撑算力扩张的关键金融工具。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic 发布 Claude Haiku 5.5 模型，价格降幅达 90% 但存在隐性成本</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1cad2a27af8601fe2ccee7556f592387.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic 正式推出轻量级模型 Claude Haiku 5.5，主打高并发、低延迟场景。在 10 万 Token 以内的常规请求中，其输入与输出价格分别降至每百万 Token 0.10 美元和 0.50 美元，账面价格较前代下降 90%。该模型引入自适应思考与动态调节功能，可根据任务复杂度平衡推理深度。值得注意的是，Haiku 5.5 采用了全新分词器，导致相同文本的 Token 消耗量增加 25% 至 30%，实际综合成本降幅约为 75%。此外，当单次请求超过 10 万 Token 时，输入与输出单价将飙升至基础价格的 5 倍。开发者需针对特定工作流精准评估 Token 消耗，以规避潜在的隐性成本陷阱。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
